## 2. Main Users & Personas

| User Role | Description | Primary Objective |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Rider** | A customer requiring point-to-point transit. | Find an available driver, book a ride, monitor ride status, cancel if needed, and view historical receipts. |
| **Driver** | A service partner operating a specific vehicle. | Register a vehicle (Car, Bike, Auto), toggle availability, accept ride dispatches, execute rides from start to finish, and track earnings/history. |

